{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Restoration of the Temple Resumed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the prophet Haggai and Zechariah the son of Iddo, prophets, prophesied to the Jews who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Judah and Jerusalem, in the name of the God of Israel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " over them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Zerubbabel the son of Shealtiel and Jeshua the son of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Jehozadak, 1 Chr. 6:14"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jozadak rose up and began to build the house of God which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Jerusalem; and the prophets of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with them, helping them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "At the same time Tattenai the governor of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the region"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beyond "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The Euphrates"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the River and Shethar-Boznai and their companions came to them and spoke thus to them: “Who has commanded you to build this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple and finish this wall?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then, accordingly, we told them the names of the men who were constructing this building. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the eye of their God was upon the elders of the Jews, so that they could not make them cease till a report could go to Darius. Then a written answer was returned concerning this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "matter."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This is a copy of the letter that Tattenai sent:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The governor of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the region"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beyond the River, and Shethar-Boznai, and his companions, the Persians who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were in the region"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beyond the River, to Darius the king."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(They sent a letter to him, in which was written thus.)"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To Darius the king:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All peace."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let it be known to the king that we went into the province of Judea, to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple of the great God, which is being built with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. stones of rolling, stones too heavy to be carried"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "heavy stones, and timber is being laid in the walls; and this work goes on diligently and prospers in their hands."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then we asked those elders, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke thus to them: “Who commanded you to build this temple and to finish these walls?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We also asked them their names to inform you, that we might write the names of the men who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " chief among them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And thus they returned us an answer, saying: “We are the servants of the God of heaven and earth, and we are rebuilding the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple that was built many years ago, which a great king of Israel built and completed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But because our fathers provoked the God of heaven to wrath, He gave them into the hand of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, the Chaldean, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " destroyed this temple and carried the people away to Babylon. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "However, in the first year of Cyrus king of Babylon, King Cyrus issued a decree to build this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Temple"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "house of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also, the gold and silver articles of the house of God, which Nebuchadnezzar had taken from the temple that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Jerusalem and carried into the temple of Babylon—those King Cyrus took from the temple of Babylon, and they were given to one named Sheshbazzar, whom he had made governor. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to him, ‘Take these articles; go, carry them to the temple "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "site"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Jerusalem, and let the house of God be rebuilt on its former site.’ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the same Sheshbazzar came "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " laid the foundation of the house of God which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in Jerusalem; but from that time even until now it has been under construction, and it is not finished.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it seems"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good to the king, let a search be made in the king’s treasure house, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " there in Babylon, whether it is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "so"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that a decree was issued by King Cyrus to build this house of God at Jerusalem, and let the king send us his pleasure concerning this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "matter."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}